  "title": "OptimisticMC",
  "description": "This mod collection will allow you to play Minecraft with higher FPS, if you have a very weak computer you should download it. Even if you have a powerful enough PC you should also try my collection.",
  "body": "# 🚀 OptimisticMC: Peak Performance for Everyone\nOptimisticMC is a meticulously curated mod collection designed to squeeze every bit of performance out of your hardware. Whether you are playing on an aging laptop or a high-end gaming rig, this pack ensures your Minecraft experience is buttery smooth and stutter-free.\n\n### ✨ Why choose OptimisticMC?\nExtreme FPS Boost: Advanced optimization of the graphics engine and data processing.\nLightweight & Clean: Only essential performance mods—no bloatware, no unnecessary features.\nMultiplayer Ready: Perfectly optimized for both solo survival and large-scale server play.\n### 🛠 Installation & Setup:\nDownload: We recommend using the Modrinth App for the best experience.\nAllocate RAM (Mandatory): Go to the \"Java and memory\" tab, check \"Custom memory allocation,\" and set your maximum RAM. This is required before your first launch to ensure stability.\nStay Updated: If you are using the Modrinth App, click the \"Update all\" button to get the latest performance patches.\n## 🐛 Feedback & Support\nFound a bug or experiencing a crash? Let us know!\nContact: [OptimisticMC report](https://t.me/optimisticMC).",
